{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-10_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-10","title":"“这种事”","storyCode":"6-11","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-10_end.txt","sourceHash":"7b14f96fdd9671780f1d82853212ba010581fceea01d16ddee3ab663298bf7da","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第四关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（呃，呃......！哈，哈......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（......中计了？！刚才的袭击居然只是佯攻？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（再让她切分我的队伍，整支大队都会失去作战能力......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（不行，得立刻联系上他们才行！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（可恶，为什么我的手指不听使唤？为什么我在打冷颤！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（不能......不能被她追上！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_18"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"呜，咳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（低沉咆哮）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"红，别杀她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......！咕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是她吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"肯定没错。红闻到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（嗅嗅）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"恶，假的。她不是狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"但气味是真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这个气味，是真狼。是第一匹真狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真狼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你这......该死的狼崽子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"不要动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，怎么会......？我竟然使不出力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"居然......居然能压制我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她还想发力。是狼的技巧。她从狼那里学过撕咬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她想反击。红能刺穿她的脊髓，让她瘫痪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"应该不用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。是你。我终于找到你......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"叛徒......叛徒！找到你了，叛徒！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亚的女儿，柳德米拉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"闭嘴！你怎么配说我父亲的名字！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"整个研究所和所有的科学家，都被乌萨斯灭口了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你是这么认为的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你还敢这么说？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"就因为你，因为你这个卑鄙的叛徒和谢尔盖一起出卖了我的父亲，出卖了所有其他科学家！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你的发色和你父亲一模一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你在说什么？你为什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"别动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想问，为什么我没对你的指控做出反应？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你这人渣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"人渣。你希望我是怎么样的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我是该胆小懦弱，贪图钱财和安逸......还是说，我应该残忍冷酷，为达目的不择手段？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的我，满足你的想象了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"我没想过......没想过你是个彻头彻尾没心没肺的冷血女人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你在杀谢尔盖的时候，他是不是忏悔了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他是亚历克斯和米莎的父亲？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，哈哈哈......就是亚历克斯带我找到了他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......整合运动吸纳了亚历克斯，杀死了他的父亲，追捕他的姐姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"红。给她一次机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"给你一个杀掉我的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"给我机会？你真知道自己说了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想放弃生命？也想和那个靠出卖同事混到切尔诺伯格高层的谢尔盖一样，忏悔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你当然会后悔。你会为自己的做过的一切后悔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"平常我都会说，“我从来没有后悔过”......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"今天我却可以坦然地告诉你，我有一件非常后悔的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——但这和你父亲的事情没有任何关系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......我要杀了你。我要杀了你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"嘶，哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"“吞下死难者的苦”......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"起雾？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"是法术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"雾......不，本质是烟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"利用口腔内的发烟器官，神经指令性应激发烟。的确是依赖感染器官的特殊化源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"站在那里说个不停......没救的家伙，你难道吓得连怎么表达恐慌都忘了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你为什么要背叛我的父亲？为什么要背叛科学家们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么！告诉我为什么——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"“凯尔希所长”！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我只是侥幸逃脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想我信你的鬼话？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。你的父亲教你读过《正当与正义》，对不对？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"给五岁的你看这本书......伊利亚也真是缺乏常识。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他真的很喜欢这本书。那是盛夏的某天，他抱着你和书经过窗户，灌木丛映着阳光的橘色。他让你向我招手，你赌气别过脸去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"够了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"当天晚上他问我——如果我们封锁了石棺，不把石棺内机械结构的存在透露给乌萨斯，能不能拯救更多人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"能不能阻止乌萨斯把这些机械运用在战争之中？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你想用这些，这些......这些花言巧语干扰我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亚是石棺封锁行动的发起者之一，他信奉的理念影响了他一生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你继承了你父亲的斗志，但你父亲的身上不只有斗志......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，你认定我是背叛者，你想杀我。你可以这么做。只不过——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"既然选择了暴力这条路，就必定会面对比你更有力的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你可以再嚣张一点。无论是什么术师，都没法看穿这片浓雾，也没法分辨出我的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"你会死的很惨。我一定，一定要你死得很惨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......（吐舌声）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"为了科学家们，为了感染者，我当然要杀了你，乌萨斯豢养的恶鬼，渣滓！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我看起来像个术师？虽然我是感染者没错......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"出来，mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊？什么......怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"怎，怎么？你的脊椎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你自己并不受迷雾影响。你看得到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么会......怎么会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"呕......！什么，你是什么，你......你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是术师。我从不依赖源石技艺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"去，mon3tr。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（欢快的嘶鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，呃呃呃！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"什么东西！这是什么东西！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊啊啊，松手，松手啊，放开我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么它的壳我刺不穿？咿！别碰我，别碰我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"湮灭她......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......头上的坠落物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（不满的尖啸）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你闹太大了。楼要塌了，别让她被砸死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"呜......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（低声嗡鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"杀了我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......你明明能轻松地杀掉我！你难道也喜欢玩弄猎物？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"杀不掉你，我还活着做什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你记着，就算死了，我也会永远诅咒你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......你真准备好受死了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想死吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......呿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我是背叛者呢？杀了我以后，你是不是会好受些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......不要......再说了！我会杀了你，我一定会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"伊利亚是我的学生，也是我的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你父亲是我带过最好的研究员之一，他的无私和专注本可以将乌萨斯前推五年。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"别说了！为什么要和我说这些，为什么，我不想听，我不关心！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你想。因为你一直在怀疑自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你没有给谢尔盖解释的机会，所以我替他说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"——我不会出卖任何人，哪怕是谢尔盖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"谢尔盖是个优柔寡断的人，但他并不贪婪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"他刚出生的儿女被乌萨斯掌握在手里，他为了拯救自己的亲人，把你父亲他们的行踪告知了当局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"时至今日，米莎和亚历克斯都死了。他出卖了秘密，却谁也没能保住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"如果......如果之前是我去救米莎，也许她和碎骨......都不会死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不......不对，不对！你明明拥有这种力量，为什么不救我父亲？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（威胁的低鸣）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"因为我做不到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我没法说服你父亲离开研究所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"柳德米拉，我在离开切尔诺伯格前把你送去了叙拉古，你却自己回到了那座城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你看，你就像你父亲一样，有时候，意志连时间都能战胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你总会回到切尔诺伯格，就像你会在这里遇到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这一切一点意义都没有？我父亲和我做的一切......都毫无意义？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"不。研究员们用他们的死保守了秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯至今都无法解析石棺内的装置，他们放弃并封存了研究设施。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在，只有些微的能量被回收利用，用于驱动切尔诺伯格的核心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“叛徒”，如果我真的配得上这个称号，那我就是乌萨斯的叛国者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你父亲的努力是有意义的。即使乌萨斯已经掩盖了一切，你也还记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我也会记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（哈欠）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......但你做的一切，又是为了什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"乌萨斯清洗了整个研究所，屠杀了科学家天性里稀少又珍贵的悲悯。真正的背叛者是贪得无厌的帝国本身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你现在的样子，你杀了谢尔盖，杀了一个连自己儿女都没法保护的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在你来到了龙门，如果你和你的感染者同胞们真的夺下了这座城市，接下来你会怎么对待它的普通市民？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是杀光他们？是奴役他们？又或者是把他们赶到荒野里，让他们自生自灭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"让他们全部感染上矿石病，成为感染者，把你们的痛苦传播给他们？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是说，你会和他们和平共处？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"你们能吗？柳德米拉，现在的整合运动能吗？你是想用这样的方式建立感染者的国家，还是说你想用这种方式去对抗乌萨斯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你想去对抗乌萨斯，为什么要来龙门？想用恐怖对抗敌人，你该怎么做才能比乌萨斯更恐怖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"（凯尔希，她在疑惑。她很害怕，她想逃跑。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"Mon3tr，回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"这样好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"她能听得见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"“弑君者”，整合运动的仇恨与你的仇恨，已经被人玩弄在股掌之间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想一想你的父亲，想想伊利亚他对你的教育吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"想一想，你究竟想向谁复仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"引你走上这条用刺杀与恐怖铺成的道路......你的领袖并不是什么心性正常的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真正理想主义的人，不会放任别人为自己而死，更不会让别人代自己行凶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"离开这里。走吧，离开这里，换一条路走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"去换一条真正能改变这片大地的路......如果你真的想的话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"她的气味消失了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"凯尔希是不是一直想见她？现在为什么不杀她？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们该不该杀死一条没家的鬣狗，即使这个家是虚假的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"问题好难。红不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那么，红，她会为杀了我这件事感到喜悦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"不会。她现在也很痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"我们不代表法律，也无权审判别人。我们有能力去杀害别人，却没有任何权力宣称杀戮是正确的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"如果她对谋杀感到兴奋与快乐，我会立刻杀死她。我一定会这么选。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红知道。她不开心，她的呼吸很乱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"现在的她会成为一株病毒毒株，在狂热的切尔诺伯格感染者中散布“不安”这种病毒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......一个人能活多少年岁，又能走过多少路？我们被蒙蔽的时间，总比我们看清事实的时候更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"何况认清事实和做出选择又是另外两回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"在她从集体复仇心理中清醒过来的那天，她会离开整合运动。即使如此，谢尔盖的血，切尔诺伯格人的血，永远在她指缝间流淌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"红......做出选择以后，就没办法再回头了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红明白。红会努力，只杀狼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"好孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"那种味道你记下了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"红记下了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"是什么样的味道？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"......不讨厌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然有血腥味，但不是凯尔希你刚才说的那种，什么心性什么常的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"真傻，塔露拉是德拉克人，狼怎么会是她呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"红","speakerId":"char_144_red","isRemote":false,"text":"走吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，走吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯尔希","speakerId":"char_003_kalts","isRemote":false,"text":"......气温下降了。时间很紧迫，是时候提高效率了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_003_kalts","aliases":["？？？","凯尔希"]},{"speakerId":"char_144_red","aliases":["？？？","红"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["弑君者"]}]}
